  "notes": [
   "The catalog text begins mid-page; the program's own title heading is not printed in the excerpt, so section_heading uses the 'Requirements' heading.",
   "Learning outcomes are printed for 'the Kinesiology Program' as a whole; this A.A-T award shares them and they are recorded here.",
   "Activity block: the rule is a maximum of one course from each of any 3 of 5 areas (Combatives: EXSC 147A-148C; Dance: DANC 112A-145B; Fitness: DANC 160A-EXSC 145C; Individual Sports: EXSC 154A-179B; Team Sports: EXSC 156A-183B). Each area prints 'Semester Units: 0.0'. All areas are recorded in one choose-3 block in catalog order; reviewer should check the one-per-area constraint.",
