   "Science/statistics block: the student picks two options, where an option is a single course or a course sequence. CHEM 200 AND CHEM 200L form one sequence option (5 units). The physics option is PHYS 125, OR the sequence PHYS 180A AND PHYS 181A (5 units), OR PHYS 195; PHYS 180A and PHYS 181A are listed as alternatives of PHYS 125 but must be taken together. Statistics option: BUSE 115 or STAT C1000 or POLI 201 or PSYC 258. Psychology/sociology option: PSYC C1000 or SOCO 101. The minimum of 2 counts options, not individual courses.",
